# Dashboard (MVP)

Command center for Ranches Thunders — summarize, do not manage.

## Purpose

Within ~5 seconds show:

- Next weekend match(es)
- Poll status (availability / carpool counts vs 11–12)
- Pending payments
- Team fund balance
- Recent notifications
- Admin quick actions (create match, add expense, ask contribution)

## Widgets (MVP)

- Next match(es)
- Availability strength
- Carpool summary
- Pending weekend payments
- Team fund balance
- Notifications
- Quick actions (role-aware)

## Rules

- Widgets load independently via query hooks
- No Supabase in widgets
- Loading / empty / error / success on every widget
- Mobile stack; desktop grid
- No large management tables on Home
